sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client<br/>(SDK / UI)
    participant API as API Server<br/>8888/TCP REST<br/>8887/TCP gRPC
    participant DB as MySQL / PostgreSQL<br/>3306/5432/TCP
    participant S3 as S3 / MinIO<br/>443/TCP
    participant MLflow as MLflow Server<br/>(optional)
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Argo as Argo Workflow<br/>Controller
    participant Driver as Driver<br/>(init container)
    participant MLMD as MLMD<br/>8080/TCP gRPC
    participant Launcher as Launcher<br/>(step container)
    participant PA as Persistence Agent
    participant SWF as Scheduled Workflow<br/>Controller

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Client,PA: Flow 1: Pipeline Run Execution
        Client->>API: POST /apis/v2beta1/runs<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        API->>DB: Store run metadata<br/>Optional TLS
        API->>S3: Store pipeline spec<br/>Optional TLS, Access Key
        opt MLflow plugin enabled
            API->>MLflow: Create MLflow run<br/>Optional TLS
        end
        API->>K8s: Create Argo Workflow CR<br/>TLS, SA token
        K8s->>Argo: Workflow event
        Argo->>Driver: Run as init container
        Driver->>MLMD: Record execution context<br/>gRPC, Optional TLS
        Driver->>K8s: Cache check, create pods<br/>HTTPS, SA token
        Driver->>Launcher: Prepare execution env
        Launcher->>S3: Download input artifacts<br/>Optional TLS, Access Key
        Note over Launcher: Execute user container
        Launcher->>S3: Upload output artifacts<br/>Optional TLS, Access Key
        Launcher->>MLMD: Record output artifacts<br/>gRPC, Optional TLS
        PA->>K8s: Watch Workflow status<br/>HTTPS, Projected token
        PA->>API: Report status & metrics<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, Projected token
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over Client,SWF: Flow 2: Scheduled Pipeline Run
        Client->>API: POST /apis/v2beta1/recurringruns<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
        API->>K8s: Create ScheduledWorkflow CR<br/>TLS, SA token
        SWF->>K8s: Watch ScheduledWorkflow CRs<br/>HTTPS, SA token
        Note over SWF: Cron/periodic trigger fires
        SWF->>K8s: Create Argo Workflow<br/>HTTPS, SA token
        Note over K8s,PA: Continues as Flow 1 (steps 6-13)
    end
